---
// Index.astro
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Growth Systems Engineer | Portfolio</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; background: #0f172a; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0; padding: 2rem; }
      .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
      h1 { color: #38bdf8; font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
      .subtitle { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
      .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
      .card { background: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem; }
      .card h3 { color: #f1f5f9; margin-top: 0; }
      .tag { display: inline-block; background: #0284c7; color: #fff; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; margin-right: 5px; }
      .btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1rem; background: #38bdf8; color: #0f172a; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <header>
        <h1>Growth Systems & Workflow Engineer</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Automating lead capture, client onboarding, and CRM pipelines for scalable businesses.</p>
      </header>

      <main>
        <h2>Featured Systems & Case Studies</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          
          <!-- Project 1 -->
          <div class="card">
            <span class="tag">Active</span> <span class="tag">Tier 1</span>
            <h3>Lead Capture & Verification Engine</h3>
            <p>Automates inbound lead qualification from Tally forms, syncs to Airtable CRM, and dispatches dynamic email notifications.</p>
            <p><strong>Stack:</strong> Tally, Airtable, Make.com, Gmail</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Project 2 -->
          <div class="card">
            <span class="tag">Tier 2</span>
            <h3>Client Onboarding Workspace Generator</h3>
            <p>Triggers upon new client intake, automatically provisions Google Drive directory trees, and prepares onboarding assets.</p>
            <p><strong>Stack:</strong> Tally, Google Drive API, Make.com</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Project 3 -->
          <div class="card">
            <span class="tag">Tier 2</span>
            <h3>Executive Daily Metrics Reporter</h3>
            <p>Schedules daily extraction of operational metrics, parses aggregate performance numbers, and emails formatted summaries.</p>
            <p><strong>Stack:</strong> Google Sheets, Array Aggregator, Gmail</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Project 4 -->
          <div class="card">
            <span class="tag">Tier 3</span>
            <h3>B2B Outbound Lead Enrichment Engine</h3>
            <p>Processes database records, enriches contact attributes using custom webhooks/HTTP APIs, and queues qualified prospects.</p>
            <p><strong>Stack:</strong> Airtable, Webhooks, Custom HTTP Modules</p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>